* SPICE netlist for the schematic

VCC 3 0 DC 10V * Voltage source from node 3 to ground
RC 3 4 1k * Resistor RC from node 3 to node 4
RB 5 3 * Resistor RB from VIN to node 3

Q1 3 5 2 NPN * NPN Transistor
VIN 5 0 DC * VIN is connected to node 5 and ground

.MODEL NPN NPN (IS=1E-14 BF=100)

.END